## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a compliant, scalable data platform with isolation and DR, beyond theory.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant isolation with Lake Formation and session tags
- Multi-region DR and S3 replication
- Ingestion pipeline (Kinesis Firehose) and Glue ETL
- Tenant-specific KMS keys and IAM role trusts
- Auditing and least-privilege access

## Code Example
```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "s3:GetObject",
        "s3:PutObject",
        "s3:ListBucket"
      ],
      "Resource": [
        "arn:aws:s3:::data-lake/tenant-id/*",
        "arn:aws:s3:::data-lake"
      ],
      "Condition": {
        "ForAllValues:StringEquals": {
          "aws:RequestTag/tenant-id": "${aws:PrincipalTag/tenant-id}"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you handle tenant onboarding/offboarding without downtime?
- What metrics would you monitor to detect cross-region DR failovers early?

## Why This Is Asked
Assesses ABAC, cross-account trust, per-tenant encryption, and test rigor for production-grade data lakes.

## Key Concepts
- ABAC with IAM tags and S3 object tags
- Per-tenant KMS CMKs and encryption context
- Cross-account role with least privilege
- Test plan including canaries and revocation

## Code Example
```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["s3:GetObject","s3:ListBucket"],
      "Resource": [
        "arn:aws:s3:::telemetry-lake/tenant-id=${aws:PrincipalTag/tenant-id}/*"
      ],
      "Condition": {
        "StringEquals": {
          "s3:ExistingObjectTag/tenant-id": "${aws:PrincipalTag/tenant-id}"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["kms:Decrypt","kms:Encrypt","kms:GenerateDataKey*"],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:kms:region:acct:key/<tenant-id-CMK-arn>",
      "Condition": {
        "StringEquals": {
          "kms:EncryptionContext:tenant-id": "${aws:PrincipalTag/tenant-id}"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```
